## TOR config for IP rotation
## SOCKS5 proxy on port 9050 (for Playwright)
## Control port on 9051 (for newnym signal)

SOCKSPort 0.0.0.0:9050
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 0
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
Log notice stdout

## Don't be a relay
ORPort 0
ExitRelay 0
BridgeRelay 0

## Performance tuning
NumCPUs 1
MaxCircuitDirtiness 60 seconds
NewCircuitPeriod 30 seconds
